WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.501
-Republicans have done
so little,

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.737
and what they have done
is so unpopular

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.772
that their only strategy
for the midterms

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:09.509
is to make up a racist scam
to scare people.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.678
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:16.215
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:18.151
The one constant
in Donald Trump's life

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.653
from his earliest days
in Manhattan real estate to now

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.621
is that he is a scam artist.

00:00:22.621 --> 00:00:24.424
He literally sold scam products

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:27.259
from a vitamin kit that was
determined by a urine test

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.261
to a Trump deodorant.

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:31.330
And I have to say
the last person

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.267
I would buy deodorant from
is Donald Trump.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:37.370
I mean, look at
how sweaty he gets.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.505
Can you imagine the ad
for that deodorant?

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:43.609
"Trump deodorant.
Always let 'em see you sweat."

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:45.645
In fact, just this week,
a new lawsuit

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.479
was filed
in Manhattan Federal Court

00:00:47.479 --> 00:00:49.615
accusing the Trump family
of defrauding investors

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:51.718
by selling them
get-rich-quick schemes.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.154
-President Trump,
three of his adult children,

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.656
and their company
are now facing a new lawsuit

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.624
over allegedly conning consumers

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:01.794
in a "systematic fraud
and pattern of racketeering."

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:04.563
-The federal lawsuit was filed
today in Manhattan,

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:06.065
and it accuses Trump,

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:08.434
his company,
and three of his children

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.503
of promoting
get-rich-quick schemes

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.073
that have harmed investors,
and that includes

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.508
a telecommunications
marketing firm,

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.010
the Trump Network,
which marketed vitamins,

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.879
and the Trump Institute,

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:22.649
which offered
real-estate seminars.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:25.584
-I can't believe
Trump had an institute.

00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:28.988
I just assumed he escaped
FROM an institute.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.057
Trump's been selling scams
his whole life.

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:32.692
If he weren't president,
he'd be selling

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.694
counterfeit video games
out of the back of his Camaro.

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:38.298
"It's an Xbok.
It's just as good."

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:39.865
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:44.870
And like the grifter he is,
Trump just makes stuff up

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.507
off the top of his head
to lure in gullible people.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.208
In a Fox interview this week,
for example,

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:51.644
he claimed he saved us
from a war with North Korea

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.412
that would have
definitely happened

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:55.515
if President Obama
were still in office.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.850
-You have news out there
that is so fake.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.019
And I can do the
greatest thing ever.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:02.187
North Korea as an example.

00:02:02.187 --> 00:02:05.958
We would have been going to war
with North Korea.

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.294
I think President Obama
would have gone to war very --

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:10.296
If he had an extra year,
he would be in right now

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:12.732
a war with North Korea.

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:17.202
-Oh, uh, I'm sorry.

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:20.440
I was just dreaming about
an extra year of Obama.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.041
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.077
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:29.581
I asked a team of
computer scientists to estimate

00:02:29.581 --> 00:02:31.116
how much younger
I'd look right now

00:02:31.116 --> 00:02:33.085
if Obama had been president
for an extra year,

00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:35.355
and this is what
they came up with.

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:36.956
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:38.724
And now as President Trump

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:40.893
is just selling his supporters
more scam products,

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:43.229
he's replaced the vitamin kit
and the deodorant

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:45.064
with a Space Force
and a border wall,

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:46.732
things he'll never
actually deliver.

00:02:46.732 --> 00:02:49.268
Just take the wall.
It doesn't exist.
It's never going to exist.

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:52.738
So now Trump is sending troops
to the border in a stunt

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:55.375
and claiming that's
just as good as a wall.

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.877
-You're talking about 10,000,
maybe 15,000

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:00.213
active-duty U.S. military
to the border --

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:02.582
more than we have fighting
the Taliban in Afghanistan,

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:04.784
more than we have
fighting ISIS in Syria.

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.152
You're really gonna do that?

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.720
&gt;&gt; It's very important. We have
to have a wall of people.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:11.791
-That's right -- the wall
isn't made of bricks anymore.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.759
It's made of people.

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:16.329
"Our amazing troops
are going to the border

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:20.266
where we will stack them on top
of each other Tetris-style."

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:22.101
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:23.903
Republicans...

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:27.773
[ Applause ]

00:03:27.773 --> 00:03:29.409
Republicans make stuff up

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:31.677
because they can't defend
their actual record.

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:32.979
For example, the GOP

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:34.814
passed a healthcare bill
in the House last year

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.449
that would have stripped away
protections

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:39.285
for preexisting conditions,
and it was massively unpopular.

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.120
So now that they're
running for re-election,

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.421
they're just lying about it.

00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:44.590
-We can protect
preexisting conditions.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.158
And you need to understand

00:03:46.158 --> 00:03:48.728
everyone agrees we're gonna
protect preexisting conditions.

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:51.930
-I am passionate about
protecting people with
preexisting conditions.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.200
-We will always
protect Americans

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.136
with preexisting conditions.

00:03:57.136 --> 00:04:00.706
-Republicans will protect people
with preexisting conditions

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:02.408
far better than the Dems.

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:05.177
-The president's healthcare plan
that he's laid out

00:04:05.177 --> 00:04:07.346
covers preexisting conditions.

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:10.449
-Okay, first, his plan doesn't
cover preexisting conditions.

00:04:10.449 --> 00:04:13.285
Second, he doesn't have a plan.

00:04:13.285 --> 00:04:15.054
The House passed a bill
last year.

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.623
That plan failed in the Senate.

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:18.458
And then we never
heard about it again.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:22.228
Sarah Sanders managed to
cram two lies into one sentence.

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:24.931
She's like the
Rick Steves of lying.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.599
"I'll show you
how to pack two lies,

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:28.434
a misdirection,
and three evasive answers

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:30.836
into a simple carry-on."

00:04:30.836 --> 00:04:32.171
Republicans don't want people

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.973
thinking about
their healthcare bill

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:36.242
or the massive tax cut
they gave to the wealthy,

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:38.010
so that's why they're
frantically spouting

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.112
one racist [bleep] idea
after another.

00:04:40.112 --> 00:04:42.982
Like Trump's latest stunt
over birthright citizenship,

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:45.318
a right enshrined
in the 14th Amendment.

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:47.420
Automatic citizenship
for anyone born in this country

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.856
is the pillar of our
post Civil War attempt

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:51.790
to build an inclusive democracy.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.192
And yet Trump claimed this week

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:55.128
that he could just
unilaterally change it

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:56.529
through an executive order,

00:04:56.529 --> 00:04:58.965
something he obviously
cannot do.

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.299
&gt;&gt; It was always told to me

00:05:00.299 --> 00:05:02.401
that you needed
a Constitutional amendment.

00:05:02.401 --> 00:05:04.837
Guess what. You don't.
-You don't.

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:06.705
-Number one,
you don't need that.

00:05:06.705 --> 00:05:09.274
Number two --
-That's very much in dispute.

00:05:09.274 --> 00:05:12.044
-Well, you can definitely do it
with an act of Congress.

00:05:12.044 --> 00:05:13.579
But now they're saying

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:15.314
I can do it just with
an executive order.

00:05:15.314 --> 00:05:17.316
-Have you talked about that
with counsel?

00:05:17.316 --> 00:05:19.285
-Yeah. I have.
-So, where in the process --

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:21.587
-It's in the process.
It'll happen.

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:23.956
With an executive order. That's
what you're talking about.

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:26.959
I didn't think
anybody knew that but me.

00:05:26.959 --> 00:05:28.827
I thought I was the only one.

00:05:28.827 --> 00:05:33.633
-Yeah, you thought you were
the only one because it's crazy.

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:36.035
Trump's like a guy who gets
put in an insane asylum,

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:37.536
and when his roommate says,

00:05:37.536 --> 00:05:39.471
"You know, the Statue of Liberty
has been spying on me,"

00:05:39.471 --> 00:05:41.974
Trump goes, "You too?
I thought I was the only one."

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:43.476
[ Laughter ]

00:05:43.476 --> 00:05:45.477
[ Applause ]

00:05:45.477 --> 00:05:47.212
And now Republicans,

00:05:47.212 --> 00:05:49.582
who spent years paying
lip service to the Constitution,

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:51.050
have been twisting
themselves in knots

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.418
to align themselves
with Trump --

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:54.787
like Texas senator Ted Cruz,
who's fully embraced Trump

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:56.488
in his tight re-election bid.

00:05:56.488 --> 00:05:58.891
When Cruz, a Constitutional
lawyer, was asked about
Trump's comments,

00:05:58.891 --> 00:06:02.161
he said, "I have long supported
ending birthright citizenship.

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:03.829
I would need to examine
the legal arguments

00:06:03.829 --> 00:06:06.832
behind an executive order,
and I haven't seen those yet."

00:06:06.832 --> 00:06:08.133
So, there you go.

00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:10.837
Ted Cruz says he needs to
look at the legal arguments.

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:14.640
If only he had known this guy
running for Senate back in 2011.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:18.010
-The 14th Amendment provides
for birthright citizenship.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.878
I've looked at the legal
arguments against it,

00:06:19.878 --> 00:06:22.381
and I will tell you,
as a Supreme Court litigator,

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:25.217
those arguments
are not very good.

00:06:25.217 --> 00:06:28.187
As much as someone may dislike

00:06:28.187 --> 00:06:30.322
the policy of
birthright citizenship,

00:06:30.322 --> 00:06:32.325
it's in the U.S. Constitution.

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:34.293
-Wow.
Somehow, Cruz lying

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:36.662
is only the second-grossest
thing about that clip

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:38.865
after his hair.

00:06:38.865 --> 00:06:42.401
I mean, look how sweaty he is.
Is he using Trump deodorant?

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:45.771
All of this birthright
citizenship talk

00:06:45.771 --> 00:06:48.173
is an extension
of Trump's latest attempt

00:06:48.173 --> 00:06:50.075
to scare people
about a migrant caravan

00:06:50.075 --> 00:06:51.844
heading toward
our southern border.

00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:55.147
In reality, the caravan is a few
thousand vulnerable people

00:06:55.147 --> 00:06:56.549
fleeing poverty and violence,

00:06:56.549 --> 00:06:58.817
who are still thousands of miles
and months away

00:06:58.817 --> 00:07:00.319
if they even get here at all.

00:07:00.319 --> 00:07:02.688
But if you listen to Trump,
it's an imminent invasion

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:04.690
full of criminals
and terrorists.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.959
-At this very moment,
large, well-organized caravans

00:07:07.959 --> 00:07:12.531
of migrants are marching toward
our southern border.

00:07:12.531 --> 00:07:15.834
Some people call it an invasion.
It's like an invasion.

00:07:15.834 --> 00:07:17.669
You're gonna find MS-13,

00:07:17.669 --> 00:07:19.205
you're gonna find
Middle Eastern.

00:07:19.205 --> 00:07:20.540
You're gonna find everything.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.541
-These are some bad people
coming through.

00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:23.809
These aren't babies.

00:07:23.809 --> 00:07:26.278
These aren't little angels
coming into our country.

00:07:26.278 --> 00:07:29.015
It's actually mostly young men
and a lot of rough people.

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:30.282
There's a lot of rough people,
John.

00:07:30.282 --> 00:07:32.384
They're pushing the women
right up into the front --

00:07:32.384 --> 00:07:34.319
not good --
and they're pushing the few kids

00:07:34.319 --> 00:07:35.554
right up to the front.

00:07:35.554 --> 00:07:38.424
When you look at that caravan,
and you look --

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:40.426
largely, very, you know,

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:44.396
big percentage of men,
young, strong.

00:07:44.396 --> 00:07:46.498
-He sounds like
a Long Island divorcée

00:07:46.498 --> 00:07:49.302
trying to convince her friends
to go out to a club.

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:53.438
"There will be lots of men,
young, strong.

00:07:53.438 --> 00:07:55.341
They love to travel."

00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:56.576
[ Laughter ]

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:58.677
Of course, implying that
they're young, strong men

00:07:58.677 --> 00:08:00.345
is just another
racist dog whistle

00:08:00.345 --> 00:08:02.347
designed to scare people,
and in doing that,

00:08:02.347 --> 00:08:05.050
Trump has had the help of a
right-wing propaganda outlet

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:06.819
that exists entirely
for one purpose --

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:08.454
to disseminate his lies

00:08:08.454 --> 00:08:10.523
and whip its audience
into a racist frenzy,

00:08:10.523 --> 00:08:11.823
and over the last few days,

00:08:11.823 --> 00:08:13.826
Fox News
has gone into overdrive,

00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:16.027
telling people
there might be more caravans

00:08:16.027 --> 00:08:18.563
and that those caravans
might be spreading disease.

00:08:18.563 --> 00:08:20.332
-This is an invasion.

00:08:20.332 --> 00:08:23.536
This is an act of attacking
the United States' sovereignty.

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:27.106
-This is a threatening,
invading force

00:08:27.106 --> 00:08:29.875
that may well
bash its way through our fence

00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:32.444
the way they did
the Guatemalan fence.

00:08:32.444 --> 00:08:33.913
-What about diseases?

00:08:33.913 --> 00:08:36.081
I mean, there's a reason why
you can't bring a kid to school

00:08:36.081 --> 00:08:37.583
unless he's inoculated.

00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:40.886
-They're coming in with diseases
such as smallpox and leprosy

00:08:40.886 --> 00:08:44.189
and TB that are gonna infect our
people in the United States.

00:08:44.189 --> 00:08:47.225
-Smallpox and leprosy?

00:08:47.225 --> 00:08:50.495
Where is this caravan
coming from, medieval England?

00:08:50.495 --> 00:08:52.764
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:52.764 --> 00:08:56.869
The last --
True story.

00:08:56.869 --> 00:09:00.806
The last naturally occurring
case of smallpox was in 1977.

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:02.441
It really makes your
scare-mongering

00:09:02.441 --> 00:09:05.011
a lot less convincing when the
only diseases you can think of

00:09:05.011 --> 00:09:07.513
are from the "Oregon Trail."

00:09:07.513 --> 00:09:10.282
But the weirdest example of Fox
spreading this racist hoax

00:09:10.282 --> 00:09:12.818
was a segment on
Lou Dobbs' show on Monday.

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:16.288
Dobbs might be Fox's most
virulent conspiracy theorist.

00:09:16.288 --> 00:09:18.290
After mail bombs were sent
to prominent Democrats,

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.391
he called them fake.

00:09:19.391 --> 00:09:21.294
He's also been
obsessively tracking

00:09:21.294 --> 00:09:22.461
the location of the caravan,

00:09:22.461 --> 00:09:24.029
which,
as we showed you last week,

00:09:24.029 --> 00:09:26.899
has sometimes given him
pronunciation trouble.

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:30.102
-The caravan of mostly
Central American immigrants

00:09:30.102 --> 00:09:33.973
is now in the Mexican city
of Wah-la-da tonight.

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:42.247
[ Laughter ]

00:09:42.247 --> 00:09:44.049
-Now I just wanted
to show you that

00:09:44.049 --> 00:09:46.118
to give you some context
for this next clip.

00:09:46.118 --> 00:09:48.354
Dobbs had a guest on
who floated a theory

00:09:48.354 --> 00:09:52.024
about the migrants spreading
disease that was so crazy,

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:54.760
even Dobbs
couldn't go along with it.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.030
-We simply cannot tolerate
the continued invasion

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.666
of this country when Americans
are suffering every day.

00:10:01.666 --> 00:10:03.602
The national debt is exploding.

00:10:03.602 --> 00:10:06.138
We have diseases spreading
across the country

00:10:06.138 --> 00:10:09.975
that are causing polio-like
paralysis of our children.

00:10:09.975 --> 00:10:11.476
It's one thing after the other.

00:10:11.476 --> 00:10:15.781
-You can't very well blame that
disease on illegal immigrants.

00:10:15.781 --> 00:10:18.150
We don't know the cause of it.

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:21.386
I don't know that that's --
I don't think that's fair.

00:10:21.386 --> 00:10:23.555
A lot of, you know --

00:10:23.555 --> 00:10:28.060
But there are plenty of reasons
to keep this country secure,

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.963
including -- including --
making sure that everyone

00:10:30.963 --> 00:10:33.398
is healthy when they are
brought into the country,

00:10:33.398 --> 00:10:37.536
without question, right?
Is that fair?

00:10:37.536 --> 00:10:39.705
-That is fair.
But that is part of the problem.

00:10:39.705 --> 00:10:42.741
We don't know where the diseases
are coming from.

00:10:42.741 --> 00:10:45.477
-[ Laughing ] Well, that's --
You know what?

00:10:45.477 --> 00:10:49.115
I think, with that,
we're going to leave it.

00:10:49.115 --> 00:10:50.415
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.415 --> 00:10:52.284
-"Wah-da-la!"

00:10:52.284 --> 00:10:54.120
[ Laughter ]

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.523
Lou Dobbs just had that moment
that a lot of us had in our 20s.

00:10:57.523 --> 00:10:59.759
Remember, you're at a party
at someone's house,

00:10:59.759 --> 00:11:01.059
and you look around, and you go,

00:11:01.059 --> 00:11:04.596
"Man, everybody at this party
is an ass [bleep]."

00:11:04.596 --> 00:11:08.367
And then you go,
"Wait. I'm at this party."

00:11:08.367 --> 00:11:09.768
[ Laughter ]

00:11:09.768 --> 00:11:12.137
The caravan hysteria
has spun so far out of control

00:11:12.137 --> 00:11:13.606
that Shepherd Smith
actually had to look

00:11:13.606 --> 00:11:15.274
straight into the camera
this week

00:11:15.274 --> 00:11:18.377
and reassure Fox viewers
that they were not in danger.

00:11:18.377 --> 00:11:20.879
-The migrants, according to
Fox News reporting,

00:11:20.879 --> 00:11:23.348
are more than two months away.

00:11:23.348 --> 00:11:25.751
If any of them
actually come here.

00:11:25.751 --> 00:11:30.923
But tomorrow is one week
before the midterm election,

00:11:30.923 --> 00:11:33.725
which is what
all of this is about.

00:11:33.725 --> 00:11:35.628
There is no invasion.

00:11:35.628 --> 00:11:37.930
No one's coming to get you.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.231
There's nothing at all
to worry about.

00:11:40.231 --> 00:11:42.901
-Oh, my God. Fox News
has gone so far off the rails

00:11:42.901 --> 00:11:44.670
that the only sane person
who works there

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.605
has to talk to viewers
like children

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:48.674
who accidentally
saw a scary movie.

00:11:48.674 --> 00:11:49.875
[ Laughter ]

00:11:49.875 --> 00:11:52.511
"It's okay.
There's nothing to worry about.

00:11:52.511 --> 00:11:54.380
The Babadook is not real..."

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.514
[ Laughter ]

00:11:55.514 --> 00:11:57.516
"...and it is not
coming to get you."

00:11:57.516 --> 00:11:58.851
And that's great.
The only problem is,

00:11:58.851 --> 00:11:59.885
a few hours later,

00:11:59.885 --> 00:12:01.520
Sean Hannity comes on
the same network

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.389
and screams,
"The Babadook is real,

00:12:03.389 --> 00:12:06.225
and it's outside your house!"
[ Laughter ]

00:12:06.225 --> 00:12:08.927
The caravan hysteria is a con
designed to distract everyone

00:12:08.927 --> 00:12:10.830
while Trump and his cronies
plunder the government

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.198
for their own personal gain.

00:12:12.198 --> 00:12:14.099
That's a point Obama
made over the weekend

00:12:14.099 --> 00:12:16.034
when he was campaigning
in Wisconsin.

00:12:16.034 --> 00:12:17.970
-They're trying to convince
everybody to be afraid

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:22.607
of bunch of impoverished,
malnourished refugees

00:12:22.607 --> 00:12:24.109
a thousand miles away.

00:12:24.109 --> 00:12:26.111
It's this group of folks,

00:12:26.111 --> 00:12:27.379
we don't even
know where they are.

00:12:27.379 --> 00:12:28.681
They're way down there.

00:12:28.681 --> 00:12:30.782
[ Laughter ]

00:12:30.782 --> 00:12:32.584
That's the biggest thing!

00:12:32.584 --> 00:12:37.489
And you know as soon as
the election's over...

00:12:37.489 --> 00:12:39.892
Everybody will be like,
"What? What happened?

00:12:39.892 --> 00:12:42.527
We were be being invaded?
Where'd it go?"

00:12:42.527 --> 00:12:44.830
They're giving tax cuts
out to billionaires.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.064
They don't want you
to notice that.

00:12:46.064 --> 00:12:47.766
"Look, look, look!
Over there!"

00:12:47.766 --> 00:12:48.867
[ Laughter ]

00:12:48.867 --> 00:12:50.802
They're sabotaging
your healthcare.

00:12:50.802 --> 00:12:52.605
"No, wait!
Look, look!"

00:12:52.605 --> 00:12:56.108
It's like a con,
where a door-to-door salesman

00:12:56.108 --> 00:12:57.809
tries to sell you
a security system

00:12:57.809 --> 00:13:00.745
while his buddy sneaks
in the back,

00:13:00.745 --> 00:13:03.081
takes all your stuff.

00:13:03.081 --> 00:13:05.483
It's like "Home Alone."
You remember that movie?

00:13:05.483 --> 00:13:07.352
-Oh, my God.
He's right.

00:13:07.352 --> 00:13:08.988
It is like "Home Alone."

00:13:08.988 --> 00:13:11.223
And Trump was in that, too.

00:13:11.223 --> 00:13:17.263
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:13:17.263 --> 00:13:19.364
Trump's racist fear-mongering
over immigration

00:13:19.364 --> 00:13:20.566
is the latest scam from a guy

00:13:20.566 --> 00:13:22.567
who's been scamming people
his entire life.

00:13:22.567 --> 00:13:24.269
And he's right at home
in the modern GOP.

00:13:24.269 --> 00:13:25.738
They're robbing you,
and they're trying

00:13:25.738 --> 00:13:27.238
to distracting you
while they do it.

00:13:27.238 --> 00:13:28.773
They're hoping you won't notice
until it's too late,

00:13:28.773 --> 00:13:29.841
and then you'll say...

00:13:29.841 --> 00:13:31.677
-What?
W-What happened?

00:13:31.677 --> 00:13:32.945
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:13:32.945 --> 00:13:36.749
[ Cheers and applause ]

